! ID ZE000410  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 406"; the heading row's
! LOCATION field is 021476, line 1's word.
!
! >>> STILL $EOJ, CARD SERIES ZE. <<<  PUNID 22$EOJ, low core (0214xx-
! 0215xx); no SLC printed on the page -- the origin below is line 1's
! printed LOCATION.  No TAIL.
!
! THE PAGE.  50 lines, every line number prints a "*"; a "*" after the
! LOCATION on lines 4, 26 and 49.  Contiguous 021476.00 .. 021530.00
! (line 50, a half word, so the page ends at 021530.40).
!   lines 6-7, 11, 20, 28-31, 34, 44   "-" (blank remark cards)
!   lines 32-33                        remark text
!
! >>> CARD SERIALS. <<<  ZE000410 .. ZE000459, one per line, no gaps,
! no repeats.
!
! >>> GLYPHS. <<<  The open round where only a digit can stand is 0:
! "2.C" (lines 12, 23), "CM0C00"/"CMOCOO" (36, 41, 45, 46, 48), "4C"
! (49), "O.O" (9, 16, 21, 36).  BXF (lines 10, 17, 22): the ink reads F
! and vol-1 p.66 prints BXF in the same code; BXF assembles the printed
! .23/.63 bytes.  "TLCCP1" (line 14) is TLOOP1: line 26 prints TLOOP1
! and both assemble 232227.43 (p.287's TLOOP1).  "TCSIO" (38, 39) is
! TDSIO, the worn-stem D (vol-1 p.67 "TDSIO VF,TCAT").  "TCCMBO" (42) is
! TCOMBO (vol-1).  Names "T 88A"/"T B8A": written TB8A (vol-1 p.66, and
! line 13's BZXCZ,TB8A assembles to it).  Line 41 prints "TMCAD (TIXG)"
! with a gap before the "(": the binary (000000.10 88) carries the
! TIXG index, so the gap is spacing, not a blank; written TMCAD(TIXG).
!
